hadiths[493]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1009","[AI-translation] Salam hamari millat ka tohfa aur hamare zimmiyon ke liye aman hai."
"1010","[AI-translation] Ghibat karne wala aur sunne wala [ghibat] gunah mein shareek hain."
"1011","[AI-translation] Jis ki tum ne ghibat ki us ka kaffara yeh hai ke tum us ke liye maghfirat mango."
"1012","[AI-translation] Hasad karne wala aur chughli karne wala mujh se nahin."
"1013","[AI-translation] Ghussa shaitan ki taraf se hai, shaitan aag se paida kiya gaya, aur aag pani se bujhti hai; to jab tum mein se koi ghussa ho to woh wuzu kare."
"1014","[AI-translation] Ghussa angara hai jo Adam ke bete ke dil mein jalta hai."
"1015","[AI-translation] Momin jaldi ghussa hota aur jaldi razi ho jata hai."
"1016","[AI-translation] Meri ummat ke behtareen woh hain jo jab ghussa hon to laut aaen [use rok len]."
"1017","[AI-translation] Sab se badi khayanat yeh hai ke tum apne bhai se koi baat kaho, woh tum par bharosa kare, halanke tum us se jhoot bol rahe ho."
"1018","[AI-translation] Jhoot se bacho, kyunke jhoot iman se door karta hai."
"1019","[AI-translation] Oont ki tarah ek saans mein na piyo; do ya teen ghoont mein piyo; jab peena shuru karo to bismillah kaho; jab farigh ho kar utho to alhamdulillah kaho."
"1020","[AI-translation] Us [yani apne baap] ke aage na chalo, us se pehle na baitho, aur use us ke naam se na pukaro."
"1021","[AI-translation] Gunahon mein se Allah jis ka chahe azab qayamat tak moakhar kar deta hai, siwae walidain ki nafarmani ke; Beshak Allah walidain ke nafarman ko maut se pehle duniya mein saza de deta hai."
"1022","[AI-translation] Beshak sadqe aur sila-rehmi se Allah umar badhata hai aur buri maut se bachata hai."
"1023","[AI-translation] Allah sila-rehmi ki barkat se logon ke ilaqe aabad farmata hai aur un ke maal badhata hai."
"1024","[AI-translation] Jo teen sifaat rakhta ho, to Allah us se aasan hisab lega aur use apni rehmat se jannat mein dakhil karega [woh]: jo tumhen na de use do, jo tum se tode us se jodo, aur jo tum par zulm kare use muaf kar do."
"1025","[AI-translation] Jab koi apne bhai se juma se wapas aakar mile to use kehna chahie taqabbalallahu minna wa minka [Allah ham se aur tum se qubool farmaye]."
"1026","[AI-translation] Ek doosre ko tohfe do, kyunke woh mohabbat paida karte hain aur keena door karte hain."
"1027","[AI-translation] Ek doosre ko tohfe do, kyunke tohfe dil ki beemariyan aur shak door karte hain."
"1028","[AI-translation] Ek doosre se musafaha karo, tumhare dilon se keena door ho jaega."
"1029","[AI-translation] Jab do Musalman milen aur musafaha karen, Allah ki hamd karen, aur maghfirat mangen, to unhen bakhsh diya jata hai."
"1030","[AI-translation] Jab momin momin se musafaha kare to un donon par sau rehmten utarti hain ..."
"1031","[AI-translation] Apne bhai se jhagda na karo, us ka mazaq na udao, aur us se wada karke khilaf na karo."
"1032","[AI-translation] Do sifaat momin mein jama nahin ho saktin: bakhl aur bad-akhlaqi."
"1033","[AI-translation] Dhokebaaz, bakheel aur bad-sulook jannat mein dakhil na hoga."
"1034","[AI-translation] Nahoosat bad-akhlaqi hai."
"1035","[AI-translation] Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aaina dekhte hue yeh dua farmate the: Aey Allah jaisa Tun ne meri khilqat khoobsurat banai, mere akhlaq bhi khoobsurat bana."
"1036","[AI-translation] Jo naujawan budhe ki umar ki wajah se izzat kare to Allah us ke budhape mein us ki izzat karne wala muqarrar kar dega."
"1037","[AI-translation] Ek din woh baithe the, phir un ke razai walid aae, to unhon ne apne kapde ka hissa bichhaya aur woh us par baithe; phir un ki walida aain, to unhon ne apne kapde ka doosra kinara bichhaya aur woh us par baithin ..."
"1038","[AI-translation] Izzat se inkar sirf gadha karta hai."
"1039","[AI-translation] Agar haya koi shakhs hoti to woh nek shakhs hoti; agar be-hayai koi shakhs hoti to woh [bura] shakhs hota."
"1040","[AI-translation] Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki zaban se us par la'nat jo halqe ke darmiyan baithe."
"1041","[AI-translation] Aadmi ka husn us ki zaban ki fasaahat hai."
"1042","[AI-translation] Meri ummat ko meri hadeesen na sunao siwae un ke jinhen un ki aqalen samajh saken."
"1043","[AI-translation] Woh (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab koi hadees bayan farmate muskurate the."
"1044","[AI-translation] Main khel se nahin aur khel mujh se nahin."
"1045","[AI-translation] Musalman ko na darao, kyunke Musalman ko darana bada zulm hai."
"1046","[AI-translation] Faraiz ke baad Allah ko sab se mahboob amal Musalman ko khushi dena hai."
"1047","[AI-translation] Jo Musalman gharane ko khushi de, to Allah use jannat se kam badle par razi na hoga."
"1048","[AI-translation] Beshak Aap ne kabhi jamai nahin li."
"1049","[AI-translation] Beshak Allah chheenk aur jamai mein awaz buland karne ko napasand farmata hai."
"1050","[AI-translation] Jo chheenke, dakkar le, ya chheenk ya dakkar sun kar kahe: Sab tareef Allah ke liye har haal mein, to Allah us se sattar beemariyan door kar dega, sab se halki kodh hai."
"1051","[AI-translation] Jo Musalman chheenke aur alhamdulillah kahe to Allah us ki chheenk se ek farishta paida farmata hai jo qayamat tak Allah Azza wa Jalla ki hamd karta rehta hai."
"1052","[AI-translation] Nangapan se bacho, kyunke tumhare sath woh hai jo tum se juda nahin hota siwae pakhana aur jab aadmi apni biwi ke paas jata hai."
"1053","[AI-translation] Jannat walon ki guftagu Arabi mein hogi ..."
"1054","[AI-translation] Teen cheezon se koi mehfooz nahin: bad-gumani, bad-shuguni, aur hasad."
"1055","[AI-translation] Khat ka jawab dena haq hai jaise salam ka jawab dena."
"1056","[AI-translation] Jo apne bhai ka khat baghair ijazat dekhe, goya us ne aag mein dekha."
"1057","[AI-translation] Duniya murdaar hai, us ke talabgar kutte hain."
"1058","[AI-translation] Jis ke paas cheezen ziyada hon us ki mashghooliyat ziyada hogi; jis ki mashghooliyat ziyada ho us ka lalach ziyada hoga; jis ka lalach ziyada ho us ki fikr ziyada hogi; jis ki fikr ziyada ho woh apne Rabb se ghafil ho jaega."
"1059","[AI-translation] Agar tum chahte ho ke Allah se milo jabke Woh tum se razi ho, to jo rizq tumhen diya gaya use na chhupao aur jo tum se manga jae use na roko."
"1060","[AI-translation] Jo subah kare jabke us ki fikr duniya ho to us ka Allah se koi talluq nahin."
"1061","[AI-translation] Us mein koi khair nahin jo maal jama na kare ... apni sila-rehmi ke liye, apni amanat ada karne ke liye, aur apne Rabb ki makhlooq se be-niyaaz hone ke liye."
"1062","[AI-translation] Allah us faqeer par la'nat farmaye jo ameer ke samne sirf us ke maal ki wajah se jhuke."
"1063","[AI-translation] Jo ameer ke samne sirf us ki daulat ki wajah se jhuke, to us ke deen ke do tahai zae ho gae."
"1064","[AI-translation] Har ummat ki kunji hai, jannat ki kunji faqeer aur miskeen hain; yeh log qayamat ke din Allah ki majlis mein honge."
"1065","[AI-translation] Mujh se apni niyyaton se milo, apne a'mal se nahin."
"1066","[AI-translation] Gunah ke chhote hone ko na dekho, balke Us ki azmat ko dekho jis ki tum nafarmani kar rahe ho."
"1067","[AI-translation] Tohmat ki jaghon se bacho."
"1068","[AI-translation] Jab banda tawazo kare to Allah use saatwen aasman ki taraf utha deta hai."
"1069","[AI-translation] Mazboot aur sakht bano, teer-andazi ki mashq karo, aur nange paon chalo."
"1070","[AI-translation] Dua ibadat ka maghz hai."
"1071","[AI-translation] Dua mein susti na karo, kyunke dua se koi halak nahin hota."
"1072","[AI-translation] Dua momin ka hathyar hai, deen ka sutoon hai, aur aasman aur zameen ka noor hai."
"1073","[AI-translation] Koi kisi qaum ki imamat karke sirf apne liye dua na kare unhen chhor kar; agar aisa kare to us ne un se khayanat ki."
"1074","[AI-translation] Tum mein se har ek apne Rabb se apni tamam hajaten mange yahan tak ke joote ka toota tasma bhi mange."
"1075","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab dua mein donon hath uthate to unhen chehre par pherne se pehle neeche na late."
"1076","[AI-translation] Allah se hatheliyon ke andaruni hisse se mango, un ki peeth se na mango; jab farigh ho to unhen chehron par phero."
"1077","[AI-translation] Beshak Allah dua mein israr karne walon se mohabbat farmata hai."
"1078","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab Allah bande ki rooh [subah] wapas kare, phir woh yeh dua padhe La ilaha illallah wahdahu la shareeka lah lahul-mulku wa lahul-hamdu wa Huwa ala kulli shaiin qadeer, to Allah us ke tamam gunah bakhsh deta hai agarche samandar ki jhaag ke barabar hon."
"1079","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo neend se jagte hue yeh dua padhe: Sab tareef Allah ke liye jis ne neend aur bedari paida ki, sab tareef Allah ke liye jis ne mujhe sahi salim uthaya, main gawahi deta hun ke Allah murdon ko zinda farmata hai aur Woh har cheez par qadir hai; to Allah Azza wa Jalla farmata hai: Mere bande ne sach kaha."
"1080","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek aadmi ko sone se pehle Surah Hashr padhne ki waseeyat ki, aur farmaya: agar [use padh kar] mar jao to shaheed ki maut paoge."
"1081","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo subah yeh dua padhe us ne us din ka shukr ada kiya; jo shaam padhe us ne us raat ka shukr ada kiya."
"1082","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo subah ya shaam ek martaba yeh dua padhe: Aey Allah Beshak main subah karta hun Tujhe gawah bana kar aur Tere Arsh uthane walon, Tere farishton, aur Teri tamam makhlooq ko gawah bana kar: Tu Allah hai, Tere siwa koi mabud nahin, aur Muhammad Tere bande aur Rasool hain; to Allah us ka chauthai hissa jahannam se azad kar dega. Jo do martaba padhe, Allah us ka aadha hissa jahannam se azad kar dega. Jo teen martaba padhe, Allah us ka teen chauthai jahannam se azad kar dega. Agar chaar martaba padhe to Allah use [poori tarah] jahannam se azad kar dega."
"1083","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo subah yeh aayaten padhe: To Allah ki tasbeeh karo jab shaam karo aur jab subah karo, Us ke liye hamd hai aasmanon aur zameen mein aur pichhle pehar aur jab tum dopahar karo; Woh zinde ko murde se nikalta hai aur murde ko zinde se nikalta hai, aur zameen ko us ki maut ke baad zinda farmata hai; isi tarah tum nikale jaoge; to jo khair aur barkat us din reh gayi woh use pa lega; jo shaam padhe to jo khair aur barkat reh gayi woh use pa lega."
"1084","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo subah yeh dua padhe woh shaam tak mehfooz rahega; jo shaam padhe woh subah tak mehfooz rahega: Subhanallah wa bihamdihi la quwwata illa billah ma sha Allah kana wa ma lam yasha lam yakun."
"1085","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo subah A'oozu billah-is-Sami-il-Aleem min-ash-Shaitan-ir-Rajeem teen martaba padhe phir Surah Hashr ki aakhri teen aayaten padhe, to Allah us ke liye sattar hazar farishte muqarrar kar dega jo shaam tak us ke liye dua karenge; agar woh us din mar jae to shaheed ka martaba payega. Jo shaam kahe to us ke liye bhi subah tak waisa hi hoga."
"1086","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Har din jab bande subah karte hain, [Allah ki taraf se] pukarne wala buland awaz se pukarta hai: Subhan-al-Malik-il-Quddus; aur ek riwayat mein hai: Har subah pukarne wala pukarta hai: Aey tamam makhlooq! [Allah] Badshah, Nihayat Paak ki tasbeeh karo."
"1087","[AI-translation] Ek riwayat mein hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) subah yeh kalimaat farmate the: Ham ne subah ki aur badshahat Allah ke liye hai, sab tareef Allah ke liye hai, kibriya aur azmat Allah ke liye hai, makhlooq, hukm, raat, din, aur jo un mein thehra hai Allah ke liye hai; Aey Allah is din ke awwal ko bhalai, darmiyan ko kamyabi, aur aakhir ko falah bana, aey sab se ziyada rehem farmane wale."
"1088","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) subah shaam yeh dua padhte the: Aey Allah Beshak main Tujh se achanak khair mangta hun, aur Tujh se achanak shar se panah mangta hun."
"1089","[AI-translation] Museebat se hifazat ke liye, Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek aadmi ko subah padhne ki yeh dua sikhai: Apni zaat, ghar walon aur maal par Allah ke naam se, kyunke tumhara kuch zae nahin hoga."
"1090","[AI-translation] Ek riwayat mein hai ke jo juma ki subah fajr se pehle teen martaba yeh dua padhe: Main Allah se maghfirat mangta hun jis ke siwa koi mabud nahin Woh Zinda Qayam hai aur main Us se tauba karta hun; to us ke tamam gunah bakhsh diye jaenge agarche samandar ki jhaag ke barabar hon."
"1091","[AI-translation] Jab Hazrat Zaid bin Sabit (Raziyallahu anhu) ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se be-khwabi ki shikayat ki, Aap ne unhen yeh dua sikhai: Aey Allah sitare doob gae aur aankhen sukoon pa gayin, jabke Tu Zinda Qayam hai, Tujhe na oongh aati hai na neend; aey Zinda Qayam, meri raat sukoon de aur meri aankh sula de."
"1092","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) bait-ul-khala mein dakhil hote hue yeh dua padhte the: Aey Allah Beshak main Tujh se na-paak khabees halak karne wale: mardood shaitan se panah mangta hun."
"1093","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) bait-ul-khala se nikalte hue yeh dua padhte the ... Sab tareef Allah ke liye jis ne mujh se takleef door ki aur mujhe aafiyat di."
"1094","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) bait-ul-khala se nikalte hue yeh dua padhte the ... Sab tareef Allah ke liye jis ne mujhe us ka zaeqa diya, us ki quwwat mujh mein baqi rakhi, aur us ki takleef mujh se door ki."
"1095","[AI-translation] Wuzu se farigh hone ke baad aasman ki taraf dekh kar yeh dua padhe: Main gawahi deta hun ke Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin Woh akela hai Us ka koi shareek nahin aur main gawahi deta hun ke Muhammad Us ke bande aur Rasool hain."
"1096","[AI-translation] Hayya alal-falah ke jawab mein, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) yeh farmate the: Aey Allah hamen kamyab logon mein se bana."
"1097","[AI-translation] Ek riwayat mein hai ke agar tum kisi ko masjid mein sha'iri padhte dekho to use teen martaba la'nat karo: Allah tera munh tode."
"1098","[AI-translation] Jo farz namaz ke baad Ayat-ul-Kursi padhe to woh agli namaz tak Allah ki hifazat mein hoga."
"1099","[AI-translation] Ek riwayat mein hai ke namaz se farigh hone ke baad, Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) apna dayan hath peshani par pherte aur farmate: Main gawahi deta hun ke Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin Woh Rahman Raheem hai; Aey Allah mujh se fikr aur gham door farma."
"1100","[AI-translation] Ek riwayat mein hai ke Hazrat Ibn Amr (Raziyallahu anhu) iftar ke waqt yeh dua padhte the: Aey Allah Beshak main Tujh se Teri rehmat se mangta hun jo har cheez par chhai hai ke Mujhe bakhsh de."
"1101","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) dushman se muqable par yeh farmate the: Aey Maalik-e-yaum-id-deen Teri hi ibadat karte hain aur Tujh hi se madad mangte hain."
"1102","[AI-translation] Ek riwayat mein yeh salam ke alfaz hain: Aur tum par salam, Allah ki rehmat, Us ki barkaten, Us ki maghfirat aur Us ki raza ho."
"1103","[AI-translation] Jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ghar mein dakhil hote to yeh dua padhte the: Aey Allah Beshak main Tujh se behtareen dakhle aur behtareen khuruj mangta hun; Allah ke naam se ham dakhil hue aur Allah ke naam se ham nikle, aur Allah apne Rabb par ham ne tawakkul kiya."
"1104","[AI-translation] Jab tez hawaen chaltin, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ghutnon par baith jate aur dua farmate: Aey Allah use rehmat bana aur azab na bana; Aey Allah use [rehmat wali] hawaen bana aur [azab wali] hawa na bana."
"1105","[AI-translation] Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) bijli ki garaj sun kar yeh dua padhte the: Aey Allah hamen apne ghazab se qatl na farma aur hamen apne azab se halak na farma, aur is se pehle hamen aafiyat de."
"1106","[AI-translation] Jab Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko koi mamla pesh aata to aasman ki taraf dekhte aur farmate: Subhanallah wa bihamdihi."
"1107","[AI-translation] Ek riwayat mein hai ke jab kisi ko koi kaam gher le to yeh dua padhe: Hasbunallah wa ni'mal wakeel."
"1108","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum aag ki lapak dekho to Allahu Akbar kaho, kyunke takbeer use bujha degi."
"1109","[AI-translation] Jab tum beemar ke paas jao to use kaho ke tumhare liye dua kare, kyunke us ki dua farishton ki dua ki tarah hai."
"1110","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke farman ke mutabiq, jo nae kapde pehente hue yeh dua padhe Sab tareef Allah ke liye jis ne mujhe pehnaya jis se main apna satr chhupata hun aur apni zindagi mein zeenat karta hun; to woh Allah ki hifazat mein aa jaega."
"1111","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab meri ummat kashti mein sawar ho, woh doobne se bach sakte hain agar yeh dua padhen: Allah ke naam se us ka chalna aur theharna Beshak mera Rabb Bakhshne wala Meherban hai; aur unhon ne Allah ki qadar na ki jaisa us ki qadar ka haq tha ...."
"1112","[AI-translation] Ek riwayat mein hai ke jab Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) Zamzam ka pani peete to yeh dua padhte the: Aey Allah Beshak main Tujh se nafa bakhsh ilm, wasee rizq, aur har beemari se shifa mangta hun."
"1113","[AI-translation] Kya main tumhen tumhari beemari aur us ki dawa ke bare mein na bataun? Khabardar! Tumhari beemari gunah hain aur tumhari dawa istighfar hai."
"1114","[AI-translation] Jo istighfar ko lazim kare, to Allah us ke liye har tangi se nikalne ka rasta dega, us ka har gham door karega, aur use wahan se rizq dega jahan se woh gumaan bhi na kar sake."
"1115","[AI-translation] Jo [gunah ke baad] maghfirat mange us ne israr nahin kiya agarche din mein sattar martaba laut aae."
"1116","[AI-translation] Jo Nabi par durood na bheje us ka wuzu nahin."
"1117","[AI-translation] Jo juma ke din mujh par assi martaba durood bheje, to Allah us ke assi saal ke gunah bakhsh dega."
"1118","[AI-translation] Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) par durood bhejna ghulam azad karne se afzal hai."
"1119","[AI-translation] Jab tum mujh par durood bhejo to sab ko shamil karo."
"1120","[AI-translation] Apni majlison ko mujh par durood se muzayyan karo, kyunke Beshak tumhara mujh par durood qayamat ke din tumhare liye noor hoga."
"1121","[AI-translation] Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) par durood radd nahin hota."
"1122","[AI-translation] Jo har juma mujh par chalis martaba durood bheje, to Allah Azza wa Jalla us ke chalis saal ke gunah mita dega."
"1123","[AI-translation] Jab Khaleel [Ibrahim] ka aur mera zikr ho, to [pehle] un par phir mujh par durood bhejo; jab [aur] Nabiyon ka zikr ho, to [pehle] mujh par phir un par durood bhejo."
"1124","[AI-translation] Beshak Allah Azza wa Jalla ne mujhe jahanon ke liye rehmat aur hidayat bana kar bheja, aur mujhe hukm diya ke baajon aur aalaat-e-moseeqi ko mitaun."
"1125","[AI-translation] Gaana dil mein nifaq ugata hai jaise pani sabza ugata hai."
"1126","[AI-translation] Jo gane wali ko ghaur se sune, to qayamat ke din us ke kaanon mein seesa dala jaega."
"1127","[AI-translation] Gaana zina ka mantar hai."
"1128","[AI-translation] Zinda bast ka bansri bajane wala khush nahin rehta."
"1129","[AI-translation] Jo gane ki awaz ko ghaur se sune, use jannat mein roohaniyon ki awazen sunne ki ijazat na milegi."
"1130","[AI-translation] [Hazrat Abu Barzah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke ham Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath the jab Aap ne gane ki awaz suni, to farmaya: Dekho yeh kya hai? To main upar chadha aur dekha ke Mu'awiyah aur Amr bin Aas ga rahe the. Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko ittila di, to Aap ne un donon ke haq mein bad-dua farmai:] Aey Allah! Un donon ko fitne mein daal; Aey Allah! Un donon ko aag mein dhakel."
"1131","[AI-translation] Allah ne gane aur gane wale par la'nat farmai."
"1132","[AI-translation] Bila shak ishq gunahon ka kaffara hai."
"1133","[AI-translation] [Ek din Hazrat Ibn Zubair (Raziyallahu anhu) ne apne sathiyon se kaha: Kya tum jante ho is hadees ka matlab, Jo mujh par jhoot bandhe woh apna thikana jahannam mein bana le? Ek aadmi ek aurat par aashiq ho gaya. Ek shaam woh us aurat ke ghar walon ke paas aaya aur kaha: Main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ka qasid hun. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujhe tumhare paas bheja hai taake main tumhare jis ghar mein chahun rahun. Us ne shaam ka intezar kiya. Un mein se ek Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas gaya aur kaha: Falan hamare paas aaya hai aur kehta hai ke Aap ne use hukm diya hai ke woh hamare jis ghar mein chahe raat guzare. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Us ne jhoot kaha. Aey falan, is aadmi ke sath jao; agar Allah tumhen us par qudrat de to use qatl kar do aur use aag mein jala do. Lekin mera khayal hai maut use kafi hogi. Phir aasman se barish hui. Woh wuzu ke liye bahar nikla, to saanp ne use kaat liya. Jab Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko ittila di gayi to Aap ne farmaya: Woh jahannam mein hai."
"1134","[AI-translation] Aashiqon se mashwara na lo; un ki koi rae nahin. Khabardar! Un ke dil jale hue hain aur un ki aqalen chheen li gayi hain."
"1135","[AI-translation] Kisi cheez ki mohabbat andha aur behra kar deti hai."
"1136","[AI-translation] Mohabbat karne walon ki majlis tang nahin hoti."
"1137","[AI-translation] Hudood ko rok do jab tak unhe rokne ka rasta pao."
"1138","[AI-translation] Musalmanon se hudood ko jahan tak ho sake roko."
"1139","[AI-translation] Jab chor par hadd qayam kar di jae to us par maal ki zamanat nahin."
"1140","[AI-translation] Aurat murtad ho jae to use qatl na karo."
"1141","[AI-translation] Badkaron ke chehre aag se dahkae jaenge."
"1142","[AI-translation] Zina na karo warna tumhari aurton ki lazzat jati rahegi ..."
"1143","[AI-translation] Jo Yahudi ya Isai aurat se zina kare, to Allah use qabr mein jalaega."
"1144","[AI-translation] Allah qayamat ke din padosi ki biwi se zina karne wale ki taraf rehmat se nahin dekhega, na use paak karega, aur us se farmayega: Jahannam mein jane walon ke sath dakhil ho ja."
"1145","[AI-translation] Jo zina kare to woh usi se zina hai agarche apne ghar ki deewar se ho."
"1146","[AI-translation] Zina ki aulad qayamat ke din bandaron aur khinzeeron ki surat mein uthai jaegi."
"1147","[AI-translation] Jo zina mein ek dirham kharch kare us ne chhe sau dirham ganwa diye."
"1148","[AI-translation] Beshak Hazrat Umar ne apne bete jis ki kunniyat Abu Shahmah thi us par us ki maut ke baad hadd qayam ki ..."
"1149","[AI-translation] Liwat karne wala agar baghair tauba mare to qabr mein khinzeer bana diya jata hai."
"1150","[AI-translation] Jo ladke ko khwahish se bosa de, Allah us par la'nat farmata hai; agar use khwahish se musafaha kare to us ki namaz qubool nahin hoti; agar use khwahish se gale lagaye to use jahannam ki aag ke kodon se mara jaega; aur agar us se badkari kare to Allah use aag mein dakhil karega."
"1151","[AI-translation] Koi mard us se kam haya wala nahin jo apni dubur [mein dakhool] ki ijazat de."
"1152","[AI-translation] Jo jan boojh kar apne Musalman bhai ke satr ko dekhe, to Allah chalis din tak us ki namaz qubool nahin farmata."
"1153","[AI-translation] Jo apni aankhen haraam se bhare, to Allah us ki aankhen jahannam ke angaron se bhar dega."
"1154","[AI-translation] Abdul Qais ka wafd Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya; un mein ek raushan chehre wala ladka tha, to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne use apne peeche bithaya aur farmaya: Dawud ki khata sirf nazar thi."
"1155","[AI-translation] Ameeron ke bachchon ke sath na baitho, kyunke un ka fitna kuwari ladkiyon ke fitne se sakht hai."
"1156","[AI-translation] Jo shatranj khele woh mal'oon hai."
"1157","[AI-translation] Shatranj khelne wala khinzeer ka gosht khane wale ki tarah hai ..."
"1158","[AI-translation] Gale mein talwar latkaye namaz padhne wale ki namaz baghair latkaye [padhne wale] se saat sau guna afzal hai."
"1159","[AI-translation] Farishte mujahid ke liye musalsal dua karte hain jab tak us ki talwar ka patta us ki gardan mein hai."
"1160","[AI-translation] Jo Allah ke raste mein jihad ke liye khud-bakht pehne, to Allah use bakhsh dega ..."
"1161","[AI-translation] Jo apne liye aag se dare woh sahil par chalis din pehra de."
"1162","[AI-translation] Jo Allah ke raste mein ek takbeer kahe, to woh us ke tarazu mein chattan hogi jo saat aasmanon se bhari hogi."
"1163","[AI-translation] Beshak jab qaum Islam laye to unhon ne apne khoon aur maal mehfooz kar liye."
"1164","[AI-translation] Jo do ghodon ke darmiyan [teesra] ghoda dakhil kare jabke use yaqeen na ho ke jeetega, to koi harj nahin; agar yaqeen ho to yeh juwa hai."
"1165","[AI-translation] Beshak badshah Allah ka saya aur Us ka neza hai zameen par."
"1166","[AI-translation] Jab Allah kisi makhlooq ko khilafat ke liye paida karne ka irada farmaye to Us ke maathe par apna dayan hath pherta hai."
"1167","[AI-translation] Log apne badshahon ke deen par hain."
"1168","[AI-translation] Anqareeb aakhri zamane mein zalim hukmaran honge; jo un ke kode aur talwar se dare woh unhen na neki ka hukm de na burai se roke."
"1169","[AI-translation] Mazloom ki dua qubool hoti hai jab tak woh zalimon se ziyada na hon; agar un se ziyada ho jaen to un ki dua qubool nahin hoti."
"1170","[AI-translation] Jo zalim ki madad kare, to Allah [us zalim ko] us par musallat kar deta hai."
"1171","[AI-translation] Pehle-bargah, sipahi, aur zalimon ke madadgar jahannam ke kutte hain."
"1172","[AI-translation] Allah ka ghazab us par sakht hota hai jo us par zulm kare jis ka Allah ke siwa koi madadgar na ho."
"1173","[AI-translation] Aey Abu Hurairah! Hukmaranon par la'nat na karo, kyunke Allah ne ek giroh ko jahannam mein is liye bheja ke woh apne hukmaranon par la'nat karte the."
"1174","[AI-translation] Firaun barah hain: paanch pichhli ummaton mein aur saat meri ummat mein."
"1175","[AI-translation] Jis se aadmi apni izzat bachae woh us ke liye sadqa hai."
"1176","[AI-translation] Jo zimmi ko takleef de, main qayamat ke din us ka mukhalif hunga."
"1177","[AI-translation] Jab tum ushar lene wale se milo to use qatl kar do."
"1178","[AI-translation] Allah Azza wa Jalla farmata hai: Jo Quran aur Mere zikr mein is qadar mashghool ho ke Mujh se mangne se reh jae, to Main use mangne walon ko diye jane wale se afzal dunga; aur Allah ke kalam ki tamam kalam par fazeelat aisi hai jaise Allah ki Us ki makhlooq par fazeelat hai."
"1179","[AI-translation] Surah Fatiha us ki kifayat karti hai jis ki Quran mein se koi cheez kifayat nahin karti; agar Surah Fatiha tarazu ke ek palde mein rakhi jae aur Quran doosre palde mein, to Surah Fatiha Quran par saat guna bhari hogi."
"1180","[AI-translation] Surah Fatiha mein zeher ki shifa hai."
"1181","[AI-translation] Jab tum bistar par pehlu rakho aur Surah Fatiha aur Qul Huwallahu Ahad padho, to tum maut ke siwa har cheez se mehfooz ho gae."
"1182","[AI-translation] Jo ghar mein Surah Fatiha aur Ayat-ul-Kursi padhe, us din use kisi insan ya jinn ki nazar na lagegi."
"1183","[AI-translation] Surah Fatiha Quran ke do tahai ke barabar hai."
"1184","[AI-translation] Do aayaten Quran mein se hain; donon sifarish karengi, Allah un se mohabbat farmata hai, aur donon Surah Baqarah ki aakhri aayaten hain."
"1185","[AI-translation] Jo Surah Baqarah padhe use jannat mein taaj pehnaya jaega."
"1186","[AI-translation] Beshak har cheez ki kohan [buland tareen hissa] hai, Quran ki kohan Surah Baqarah hai ..."
"1187","[AI-translation] Jo juma ke din woh surah padhe jis mein Aal-e-Imran ka zikr hai, to Allah us par ghurub-e-aftab tak rehmat nazil farmayega, aur farishte us ke liye rehmat ki dua karenge."
"1188","[AI-translation] Allah ka Ism-e-Azam jis se dua mangi jae to qubool hoti hai Aal-e-Imran ki is aayat mein hai: Keh do aey Allah badshahat ke Malik Tu jise chahe badshahat de ... waghera."
"1189","[AI-translation] Koi aadmi mushkil janwar par sawar ho phir us ke kaan mein padhe: Kya woh Allah ke deen ke siwa talash karte hain jabke Us ke aage jhuka hai jo aasmanon aur zameen mein hai khushi ya majboori se aur Us ki taraf woh lautaye jaenge; to woh Allah Ta'ala ke hukm se thehar jaega."
"1190","[AI-translation] Allah us bande ko mehroom na karega jo aadhi raat khada ho kar Surah Baqarah aur Aal-e-Imran shuru kare; aadmi ka behtareen khazana Baqarah aur Aal-e-Imran hai."
"1191","[AI-translation] Juma ke din Surah Hood padho."
"1192","[AI-translation] Surah Hood aur us ki behnon: Waqi'ah, Qari'ah, Haqqah, Iza-sh-shamsu kuwwirat, aur sa'ala sa'il ne mujhe budha kar diya."
"1193","[AI-translation] Surah Kahf ka Naam Tauraat mein Ha'ilah hai; woh apne padhne wale aur jahannam ki aag ke darmiyan rukawat banti hai."
"1194","[AI-translation] Jo Kahf ki pehli teen aayaten padhe, woh Dajjal ke fitne se mehfooz rahega."
"1195","[AI-translation] Kya main tumhen us surah ke bare mein na bataun jis ki azmat aasman aur zameen ke darmiyan bhar gayi? Us ke padhne wale ke liye waisa hi ajr hai; jo use padhe us ke agle juma tak aur teen din ziyada gunah bakhsh diye jaenge? Sahaba (Raziyallahu anhum) ne kaha: Zaroor, bataen. To Aap ne farmaya: Surah Kahf."
"1196","[AI-translation] Beshak Allah Tabaraka wa Ta'ala ne aasman aur zameen paida karne se hazar saal pehle Taha aur Yasin padhi; jab farishton ne Quran suna to kaha: Mubarak ho us ummat ko jis par yeh nazil hoga."
"1197","[AI-translation] Jo Allah ki raza ke liye Yasin padhe, to Allah us ke pichhle gunah bakhsh dega."
"1198","[AI-translation] Jo subah Yasin padh kar shuru kare to us ki hajaten poori kar di jati hain."
"1199","[AI-translation] Jo juma ki raat Surah Dukhan padhe woh bakhsh diya jaega."
"1200","[AI-translation] Jo raat mein Ha Meem Dukhan padhe to subah sattar hazar farishte us ke liye maghfirat mangte hain."
"1201","[AI-translation] Jo shaam Dukhan poori, Ha Meem Ghafir ki ibtida se Wa ilaih-il-maseer tak, aur Ayat-ul-Kursi padhe, to us se subah tak hifazat hogi; jo subah padhe us se shaam tak hifazat hogi."
"1202","[AI-translation] Jo subah teen martaba kahe: A'oozu billah-is-Sami-il-Aleem min-ash-Shaitan-ir-Rajeem aur Surah Hashr ki aakhri teen aayaten padhe, to Allah us ke liye sattar hazar farishte muqarrar kar dega jo shaam tak us ke liye rehmat ki dua karenge; agar woh us din mar jae to shaheed ki maut marega. Jo shaam kahe to use bhi wohi martaba milega."
"1203","[AI-translation] Jo raat ya din mein Hashr ki aakhri aayaten padhe phir usi raat ya din mar jae, to us ke liye jannat wajib ho gayi."
"1204","[AI-translation] Allah ka Ism-e-Azam Surah Hashr ki aakhri chhe aayaton mein hai."
"1205","[AI-translation] Jab tum bistar par leto to Surah Hashr padho. [Phir] agar mar jao to shaheed ki maut maroge."
"1206","[AI-translation] Apni aurton ko Surah Waqi'ah sikhao, kyunke woh daulat ki surah hai."
"1207","[AI-translation] Jo Surah Waqi'ah padhe aur use seekhe, to woh ghafilon mein nahin likha jaega, aur woh aur us ke ghar wale mohtaj na honge."
"1208","[AI-translation] Jo har raat Surah Waqi'ah padhe use kabhi faqa na pahunchega."
"1209","[AI-translation] Iza zulzilat aadhe Quran ke barabar hai."
"1210","[AI-translation] Jo fajr mein Alam nashrah aur Alam tara kaifa padhe to woh halak na hoga."
"1211","[AI-translation] Wuzu ke baad surah Inna anzalnah padhna."
"1212","[AI-translation] Jo apne wuzu ke baad Inna anzalnahu fi lailat-il-qadr ek martaba padhe to woh siddeeqon mein hoga; jo do martaba padhe shaheedon ke daftar mein likha jaega; jo teen martaba padhe to Allah use Nabiyon ke sath uthaega."
"1213","[AI-translation] Jo apni us beemari mein Qul Huwallahu Ahad padhe jis mein woh mare, to use qabr mein aazmaish na hogi."
"1214","[AI-translation] Jo Qul Huwallahu Ahad bees martaba padhe, to Allah us ke liye jannat mein mahal banayega."
"1215","[AI-translation] Jo Qul Huwallahu Ahad do sau martaba padhe, to Allah us ke do sau saal ke gunah bakhsh dega."
"1216","[AI-translation] Jo din mein Qul Huwallahu Ahad do sau martaba padhe, to Allah us ke liye pandrah sau nekiyan likh dega siwae is ke ke us par qarz ho."
"1217","[AI-translation] Jo qabron ke paas se guzre aur Qul Huwallahu Ahad gyarah martaba padh kar us ka sawab murdon ko bakhsh de, to use murdon ki ta'dad ke barabar sawab milega."
"1218","[AI-translation] Jo juma ki namaz ke baad Qul Huwallahu Ahad, Qul A'oozu bi Rabb-il-Falaq, aur Qul A'oozu bi Rabb-in-Naas saat martaba padhe, to Allah use agle juma tak burai se mehfooz rakhega."
"1219","[AI-translation] Har rishta aur nasab qayamat ke din kat jaega siwae mere rishte aur nasab ke."
"1220","[AI-translation] Jibreel mere paas utre aur kaha: Beshak Allah tumhen salam farmata hai aur farmata hai: Beshak Main ne us kamar [Abdullah] jis se tum nikle, us pet [Amina] jis ne tumhen uthaya, aur us god [Abdul Muttalib] jis ne tumhari parwarish ki par aag haraam kar di hai ..."
"1221","[AI-translation] Jibreel mere paas utre aur kaha: Aey Muhammad! Beshak Allah tumhen salam farmata hai aur farmata hai: Aey Mere mahboob! Beshak Main ne Yusuf ko Kursi ke noor se husn pehnaya, aur tumhare chehre ko Apne Arsh ke noor se husn pehnaya."
"1222","[AI-translation] Beshak Jibreel Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas angoor ka khosha le kar aae aur kaha: Beshak Allah tumhen salam farmata hai aur mujhe is khoshe ke sath bheja hai taake tum use khao."
"1223","[AI-translation] Meri sifarish in logon ke haq mein qubool hui: mere walid, mere chacha Abu Talib, aur mere razai bhai, yani Ibn Sa'diya."
"1224","[AI-translation] Allah ne Musa ko kalam diya, lekin mujhe [ru'yat] di; Us ne mujhe maqam-e-mahmood aur [hauze] kausar se fazeelat di."
"1225","[AI-translation] Beshak Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek aadmi ko donon bazuaon ka paseena diya, us ne use sheeshi mein rakha yahan tak ke bhar gayi; phir woh use khushbu ke taur par lagata, to Madinah wale us se achchi khushbu paate ..."
"1226","[AI-translation] Jab Iza ja'a nasrullahi wal-fath nazil hui, Muhammad ne kaha: Aey Jibreel! Meri jaan ki [maut ki] khabar de di gayi hai ..."
"1227","[AI-translation] [Aey Nabi!] Jo tum par din raat mein sau martaba durood bheje, to main us par do hazar martaba rehmat bhejunga aur us ki hazar hajaten poori karunga."
"1228","[AI-translation] Jo meri qabr ke paas mujh par durood bheje to main use sunta hun ..."
"1229","[AI-translation] Main takhliq mein pehla Nabi hun aur besat mein aakhri."
"1230","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) wafat na paye yahan tak ke padhna aur likhna seekh liya."
"1231","[AI-translation] Quran mein mera naam Muhammad hai, Injeel mein Ahmad hai, aur Tauraat mein Aheed hai."
"1232","[AI-translation] Aap ne apni wafaat se do mahine pehle [hajat] zae karne se mana farmaya."
"1233","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apni wafaat se do mahine pehle ibadat mein khalwat ki aur aurton se alag rahe."
"1234","[AI-translation] Ma'rifat mera sarmaya hai, aql mere deen ki bunyad hai, nasab meri bunyad hai ..."
"1235","[AI-translation] Beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki shahadat ki ungli darmiyani ungli se lambi thi."
"1236","[AI-translation] Main adil badshah [yani Nausherwan] ke zamane mein paida hua."
"1237","[AI-translation] Mujhe sawar ke pyale ki tarah na banao [yani mera zikr moakhar na karo]."
"1238","[AI-translation] Jab tum bachche ka naam Muhammad rakho to us ki izzat aur tauqeer karo ..."
"1239","[AI-translation] Muhammad ka khandan nabuwwat ka darakht hai, rehmat ka khandan hai, aur risalat ka maqam hai."
"1240","[AI-translation] Jo ham Ahle Bait se bughz rakhe, to Allah use Yahudi uthaega agarche woh roza rakhta ho aur namaz padhta ho."
"1241","[AI-translation] Beshak hamari jamaat qayamat ke din apni qabron se apne gunahon aur aybon ke sath niklegi, un ke chehre chaudni ke chaand ki tarah honge."
"1242","[AI-translation] Allah ka ghazab us par sakht hai jis ne mera khoon bahaya aur meri aulaad mein mujhe takleef di."
"1243","[AI-translation] Beshak Allah ne har Nabi ki aulad us ki kamar se banai, aur meri aulad Ali ki kamar se banai."
"1244","[AI-translation] Agar Ibrahim zinda rehte to Nabi hote."
"1245","[AI-translation] Beshak Allah tum se farmata hai: Abu Bakr ki beti se nikah karo ..."
"1246","[AI-translation] Mera Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se hamal zae ho gaya, to Aap ne us ka naam Abdullah rakha aur mujhe Umm Abdullah ki kunniyat di."
"1247","[AI-translation] Aey Aishah! Tum doodh se behtar ho ..."
"1248","[AI-translation] Meri tum se mohabbat kaisi hai? Aap ne farmaya: Rassi ki girah ki tarah."
"1249","[AI-translation] Apne deen ka aadha Humaira [yani Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha)] se lo."
"1250","[AI-translation] Beshak Allah ne mujhe hukm diya ke Abu Bakr ko walid, Umar ko musheer, Usman ko sahara, aur tumhen aey Ali madadgar banaun."
"1251","[AI-translation] Qayamat ke din Arsh ke neeche se pukarne wala pukarega: Muhammad ke sahaba kahan hain? Phir Abu Bakr, Umar, Usman aur Ali laye jaenge."
"1252","[AI-translation] Abu Bakr mera wazeer hai aur mere baad meri ummat ka nigran hai; Umar mera mahboob hai jo meri zaban se bolta hai; Usman mujh se hai; Ali mera bhai aur mere jhande ka uthane wala hai."
"1253","[AI-translation] Qayamat ke din Allah makhlooq ko aam tajalli farmayega, aur tumhen [aey Abu Bakr!] khaas tajalli farmayega."
"1254","[AI-translation] Mubarak ho aey Abu Bakr! Beshak tumhen namaz ke liye wuzu karane wala Jibreel tha."
"1255","[AI-translation] Jab Allah ne roohen paida kin, Us ne roohon mein se Abu Bakr ki rooh ko chuna, aur us ki mitti jannat se banai ..."
"1256","[AI-translation] Beshak Allah ne Abu Bakr ke liye aala illiyyeen mein safed yaqoot ka gumbad banaya hai."
"1257","[AI-translation] Jab Abu Bakr Siddiq paida hue, Allah jannat-e-Adan ki taraf mutawajjeh hua aur farmaya: Meri izzat aur jalal ki qasam! Main us mein sirf use dakhil karunga jo is bachche se mohabbat kare."
"1258","[AI-translation] Beshak Allah ne Abu Bakr ko Allah ke deen aur Us ki wahi par mera khalifa banaya hai; to us ki itaat karo ..."
"1259","[AI-translation] Beshak zameen se ziyada us ki shohrat aasman mein hai."
"1260","[AI-translation] Abu Bakr jaisa kaun? Logon ne mujhe jhutlaya jabke us ne meri tasdeeq ki aur mujh par iman laya ..."
"1261","[AI-translation] Qayamat ke din ... Abu Bakr ke liye kursi nasb ki jaegi phir woh us par baithega."
"1262","[AI-translation] Mujhe aasman ki taraf le jaya gaya; main jis aasman se guzra us mein apna naam likha paya: Muhammad Allah ke Rasool hain aur Abu Bakr Siddiq peeche hai."
"1263","[AI-translation] Kisi qaum ke liye jaiz nahin jis mein Abu Bakr ho ke us ke siwa koi un ki imamat kare."
"1264","[AI-translation] Agar Abu Bakr ke iman ko zameen walon ke iman se taula jae to [us ka iman] bhari hoga."
"1265","[AI-translation] Allah ne mere seene mein jo dala Woh Abu Bakr ke seene mein bhi dala."
"1266","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umar ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Abu Bakr se baat farmate jabke main un donon ke darmiyan Habshi ki tarah hota."
"1267","[AI-translation] Beshak Allah aasman mein napasand farmata hai ke Abu Bakr Siddiq khata kare."
"1268","[AI-translation] Agar main tum mein mab'oos na kiya jata to Umar mab'oos kiye jate."
"1269","[AI-translation] Jab mujhe le jaya gaya, main ne aasman mein bandhe hue ghode dekhe ... Main ne Jibreel se poocha: Yeh kin ke liye hain? Unhon ne jawab diya: Abu Bakr aur Umar se mohabbat karne walon ke liye."
"1270","[AI-translation] Is ummat mein sab se pehle jise dayan hath mein a'mal-nama diya jaega woh Umar bin Khattab honge ..."
"1271","[AI-translation] Aey Abul-Hasan! Un donon [yani Abu Bakr aur Umar] se mohabbat karo; un donon se mohabbat ki wajah se tum jannat mein dakhil hoge."
"1272","[AI-translation] Beshak duniya ke aasman mein assi hazar farishte hain jo Abu Bakr aur Umar se mohabbat karne walon ke liye Allah se maghfirat mangte hain."
"1273","[AI-translation] Jo Umar ko bura kahe to us ka thikana Saqar hai."
"1274","[AI-translation] Jo Abu Bakr aur Umar ko bura kahe to use qatl kar do aur us se tauba na mango."
"1275","[AI-translation] Me'raj ki raat main ne Arsh mein sabz shaakh dekhi jis par safed noor se likha tha: Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin, Muhammad Allah ke Rasool hain, Abu Bakr Siddiq, Umar Farooq."
"1276","[AI-translation] Tum kis ke liye ho? Us ne jawab diya: Usman bin Affan ke liye jo shaheed ho kar marega."
"1277","[AI-translation] Beshak woh Usman se bughz rakhta tha, to Allah us se bughz rakhta hai."
"1278","[AI-translation] Beshak Usman jab ek jagah se doosri jagah muntaqil hote hain to un ke liye jannat chamakti hai."
"1279","[AI-translation] Beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Usman ki taraf uthe aur unhen gale lagaya, phir farmaya: Tum duniya aur aakhirat mein mere dost ho."
"1280","[AI-translation] Har Nabi ka apni ummat mein khaleel hota hai, mera khaleel Usman bin Affan hai."
"1281","[AI-translation] Jannat ke darakhton mein koi darakht nahin siwae is ke ke us ke har patte par likha hai ... Usman Zun-Noorain."
"1282","[AI-translation] Main, Haroon bin Imran, Yahya bin Zakariya, aur Ali bin Abi Talib ek hi mitti se paida kiye gae."
"1283","[AI-translation] Main aur Ali ek hi noor se paida kiye gae."
"1284","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali ne kaha: Main Allah ka banda hun, Rasulullah ka bhai hun, aur Siddiq-e-Akbar hun ..."
"1285","[AI-translation] [Aey Ali!] Tum sab se pehle mujh par iman laye, tum qayamat ke din sab se pehle mujh se musafaha karoge, aur tum Siddiq-e-Akbar aur Farooq ho ..."
"1286","[AI-translation] Beshak agar woh us [yani Ali] ki itaat karen to woh sab jannat mein dakhil honge."
"1287","[AI-translation] Beshak mera bhai, mera wazeer, mere ghar walon mein mera khalifa, aur mere baad sab se behtar jise main apne qarz ki adai aur apne wadon ki takmeel ke liye chhorun woh Ali hai."
"1288","[AI-translation] Tum mein sab se pehle mere paas hauz par aane wala aur tum mein sab se pehle Islam lane wala: Ali bin Abi Talib hai."
"1289","[AI-translation] Jo na kahe Ali behtareen insan hain to us ne kufr kiya."
"1290","[AI-translation] Ali makhlooq mein sab se behtar hain."
"1291","[AI-translation] Main hikmat ka ghar hun aur Ali us ka darwaza hai."
"1292","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) par wahi nazil ho rahi thi jabke Aap ka sar Ali ki god mein tha ... Unhon [Ali] ne asr nahin padhi thi yahan tak ke suraj ghurub ho gaya. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se poocha: Kya tum ne namaz padhi? Unhon ne nafi mein jawab diya. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Allah se dua ki, to Ali ke liye suraj ghurub ke baad dobara tulu kar diya gaya."
"1293","[AI-translation] [Aey Ali!] Mere han tumhara martaba Musa ke han Haroon ke martabe ki tarah hai."
"1294","[AI-translation] Ali ko dekhna ibadat hai."
"1295","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hukm diya ke masjid ki taraf khulne wale tamam darwaze band kar diye jaen, siwae Ali ke darwaze ke."
"1296","[AI-translation] Aey Ali! Is masjid mein mere aur tumhare siwa kisi ke liye junubi hona halal nahin."
"1297","[AI-translation] Ali ki mohabbat nekiyon ko khati hai jaise aag lakdi ko khati hai."
"1298","[AI-translation] Jo Adam ka ilm, Nuh ki samajh, Ibrahim ka hilm, Yahya bin Zakariya ka zuhd, aur Musa bin Imran (Alaihimussalam) ki mazbooti dekhna chahe, use Ali bin Abi Talib ko dekhna chahie."
"1299","[AI-translation] Quran mein mera naam Wash-shamsi wa zuhaha hai aur Ali ka naam Wal-qamari iza talaha hai."
"1300","[AI-translation] Mere baad mera behtareen janasheen Ali hai."
"1301","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali ne kaha: Logon ne Abu Bakr ki bai'at ki, halanke Allah ki qasam main un se ziyada haqdar aur ziyada laiq tha."
"1302","[AI-translation] Is darwaze se sab se pehle dakhil hone wala Ameer-ul-Momineen aur Sayyid-ul-Mursaleen hoga ... jab Ali aae."
"1303","[AI-translation] Jo mare jabke us ke dil mein Ali bin Abi Talib se bughz ho, to use Yahudi ya Isai ho kar marna chahie."
"1304","[AI-translation] Beshak is ummat se Ali bin Abi Talib se bughz ki wajah se barish roki jati hai."
"1305","[AI-translation] Jo us taaza shaakh ko pakadna chahe jo Allah ne apne hath se lagayi, use Ali ki mohabbat ko mazbooti se pakadna chahie."
"1306","[AI-translation] Qayamat ke din mera jhanda kaun uthayega? Aap ne farmaya: Ali."
"1307","[AI-translation] Aey Allah! Ali ko aisi fazeelat de jo Tun ne us se pehle na kisi ko di na us ke baad kisi ko dega."
"1308","[AI-translation] Beshak Ali ke bare mein teen sau aayaten nazil huin."
"1309","[AI-translation] Aey Ali! Beshak Allah ne tumhen, tumhari aulad, tumhare bachchon, tumhare ghar walon, tumhare giroh, aur tumhare giroh se mohabbat karne walon ko bakhsh diya."
"1310","[AI-translation] Jo mujh se mohabbat kare use Ali se mohabbat karni chahie; jo Ali se bughz rakhe to us ne mujh se bughz rakha ..."
"1311","[AI-translation] Woh marega siwae qatl ho kar, yani Ali."
"1312","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko ghusl diya phir main ne Aap ki aankhon ke halqon ka pani piya, to mujhe awwaleen aur aakhireen ke ilm ka waris banaya gaya."
"1313","[AI-translation] Qayamat ke din Allah mujh se aur Ali bin Abi Talib se farmayega ..."
"1314","[AI-translation] Aey Ali! Tum aur tumhara giroh jannat mein hoge."
"1315","[AI-translation] Meri misaal darakht ki tarah hai: main us ki jad hun aur Ali us ki shaakh hai."
"1316","[AI-translation] Beshak Allah ne Nabi ko hukm diya ke Jibreel ke laye hue jannat ki taaza khajooron ke thaaal se khae, aur unhen Khadijah se milne ka hukm diya; to Khadijah ne Fatimah ko hamal mein liya."
"1317","[AI-translation] Jab mujhe aasman ki taraf le jaya gaya, Jibreel ne mujhe jannat mein dakhil kiya aur mujhe ek seb diya; main ne use khaya, to woh meri kamar mein nutfa ban gaya; jab main neeche utara, main Khadijah se mila; Fatimah us nutfe se hain."
"1318","[AI-translation] Main, Fatimah aur Ali jannat mein safed gumbad mein honge jis ki chhat Rahman ka Arsh hoga."
"1319","[AI-translation] Beshak Allah ne mujhe hukm diya ke Fatimah ka Ali se nikah karun, to main ne kiya ..."
"1320","[AI-translation] Aey Ali! Beshak Allah ne tumhara Fatimah se nikah kar diya aur us ka mehar zameen banaya; to jo tum se bughz rakhte hue us par chale woh haraam chalega."
"1321","[AI-translation] Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne jab Fatimah ka Ali se nikah kiya to khutba diya, phir farmaya: Sab tareef Allah ke liye jo apni nemat se tareef kiya gaya, apni qudrat se ibadat kiya gaya ..."
"1322","[AI-translation] Beshak Jibreel ne aasman mein khutba diya aur Fatimah ka Ali se nikah kar diya ..."
"1323","[AI-translation] Jab Fatimah ko Ali ke paas bheja gaya, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) un ke aage the, Jibreel daen taraf the, Mikail baen taraf the, aur sattar hazar farishte peeche the jo fajr tulu hone tak Allah ki tasbeeh aur taqdees karte rahe."
"1324","[AI-translation] Meri beti Fatimah insani hoor hai; use na haiz aaya na nifas; use Fatimah is liye naam diya gaya kyunke Allah ne use aur us se mohabbat karne walon ko aag se rok diya hai."
"1325","[AI-translation] Beshak Fatimah ne apni izzat ki hifazat ki, to Allah ne un par aur un ki aulad par jahannam ki aag haraam kar di."
"1326","[AI-translation] Mere aur mere bete ke qatil ke darmiyan faisla farma."
"1327","[AI-translation] Qayamat ke din parde ke peeche se pukarne wala pukarega: Aey jama hone walon! Fatimah bint Muhammad ke guzarne tak apni nazren jhukao."
"1328","[AI-translation] Jibreel mere paas aae: Ali se mohabbat karo; jo Ali se mohabbat kare use Fatimah se mohabbat karni chahie ..."
"1329","[AI-translation] Jo mujh se mohabbat kare use Ali se mohabbat karni chahie; jo Ali se mohabbat kare use Fatimah se mohabbat karni chahie."
"1330","[AI-translation] Jannat ne kaha: Aey Rabb! Kya Tun ne mujh se wada nahin kiya tha ke Mujhe apne do sutunon se muzayyan karega? Us ne farmaya: Kya Main ne tumhen Hasan aur Husain se muzayyan nahin kiya?"
"1331","[AI-translation] Aey Jibreel! Main ne Husain ke badle Ibrahim ko fidya diya."
"1332","[AI-translation] Allah tumhare qatil par la'nat farmaye. To main ne poocha: Us ka qatil kaun hai? Aap ne farmaya: Meri ummat ka ek aadmi jo meri aulaad se bughz rakhega; use meri shafa'at naseeb na hogi."
"1333","[AI-translation] Abbas bin Abdul Muttalib mere walid, mere chacha, mere wasee, aur mere waris hain."
"1334","[AI-translation] Mere chacha Abbas ne jahiliyyat aur Islam mein apni sharmgah ki hifazat ki, to Allah ne un ke badan ko aag par haraam kar diya."
"1335","[AI-translation] Main ne Abdur Rahman bin Auf ko ghisat kar jannat mein dakhil hote dekha."
"1336","[AI-translation] Beshak Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Ali ke hath se qalam liya aur use Mu'awiyah ko de diya."
"1337","[AI-translation] Beshak Banu Hashim ki ek jamaat ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se darkhwast ki ke likhne ka kaam Mu'awiyah se le liya jae, to un ke taqarrur ke bare mein wahi nazil hui."
"1338","[AI-translation] Is ummat mein sab se pehle Rabb ke samne jhagadne wale Ali aur Mu'awiyah honge."
"1339","[AI-translation] [Hazrat Jibreel (Alaihissalam) ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kaha ke Allah Azza wa Jalla farmata hai:] Aey Mere mahboob! Main ne yeh qalam apne Arsh ke upar se Mu'awiyah ko tohfe mein bheja hai ..."
"1340","[AI-translation] Phir Aap ne Mu'awiyah ke bare mein Jibreel se mashwara kiya, to Jibreel ne kaha: Use katib bana lo, kyunke woh ameen hai."
"1341","[AI-translation] Allah ke han ameen teen hain: main, Jibreel, aur Mu'awiyah."
"1342","[AI-translation] Mu'awiyah ko mere paas bulao ... kyunke woh qawi ameen hai."
"1343","[AI-translation] Beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Mu'awiyah ko neza diya aur farmaya: Is neze ko pakde rakho yahan tak ke us ke sath jannat mein mujh se milo."
"1344","[AI-translation] Phir Aap ne Mu'awiyah ko teen daftar diye aur farmaya: In ke sath jannat mein mujh se miloge."
"1345","[AI-translation] Mu'awiyah qayamat ke din uthaya jaega jabke us par iman ke noor ki chadar hogi."
"1346","[AI-translation] Har ummat ka Firaun hai, is ummat ka Firaun Mu'awiyah hai."
"1347","[AI-translation] Jab tum Mu'awiyah ko mere mimbar par khutba dete dekho to use qatl kar do."
"1348","[AI-translation] Mu'awiyah bin Abi Sufyan meri ummat mein sab se burdbar aur sab se sakhi hai."
"1349","[AI-translation] Beshak meri ummat par jahannam ki garmi hammam ki garmi ki tarah hai."
"1350","[AI-translation] Jannat tamam ummaton par haraam rahegi yahan tak ke main aur meri ummat us mein dakhil hon."
"1351","[AI-translation] Meri ummat rehmat wali ummat hai; us par [aakhirat mein] azab nahin, us ki saza duniya mein zalzalon aur fitnon ki surat mein jaldi de di gayi."
"1352","[AI-translation] Arab se teen wajah se mohabbat karo: kyunke main Arabi hun, Quran Arabi hai, aur jannat walon ki guftagu Arabi hai."
"1353","[AI-translation] Behtareen log Arab hain, Arab mein behtareen Quraish hain, aur Quraish mein behtareen Banu Hashim hain."
"1354","[AI-translation] Beshak Allah ke aasman mein lashkar hain aur zameen mein lashkar hain; Us ka aasman mein lashkar farishte hain, zameen mein lashkar Khurasan wale hain."
"1355","[AI-translation] Allah ke han badtareen guftagu Farsi hai ..."
"1356","[AI-translation] Beshak Allah Ta'ala jab razi ho to Arabi mein wahi nazil farmata hai, jab naraz ho to Farsi mein wahi nazil farmata hai."
"1357","[AI-translation] Tum mein se jo achchi Arabi bol sakta ho woh kabhi Farsi na bole, kyunke Farsi nifaq lati hai."
"1358","[AI-translation] Ajam ki sunnat mitao aur Arab ki sunnat zinda karo."
"1359","[AI-translation] Jo apne ghar mein Habshi ko dakhil kare, to Allah us ke ghar mein barkat dakhil kar dega."
"1360","[AI-translation] Habshi jab ser ho to zina kare, jab bhooka ho to chori kare."
"1361","[AI-translation] Yahud aur Hind se bacho agarche sattar peton se ho."
"1362","[AI-translation] Beshak Allah ke kuch farishte hain jo murdon ko muntaqil karte hain."
"1363","[AI-translation] Beshak Allah ka ek farishta hai jis ki donon aankhon ke konon ke darmiyan paanch sau saal ki musafat hai."
"1364","[AI-translation] Beshak Allah ka ek farishta hai jis ke jism ka upari aadha barf hai aur neeche wala aadha aag hai ..."
"1365","[AI-translation] Aasman walon ka moazzin Jibreel hai aur un ka imam Mikail hai ..."
"1366","[AI-translation] Tehband is tarah bandho jaise main ne farishton ko apne Rabb ke samne bandhte dekha aadhi pindli tak."
"1367","[AI-translation] Apni dadhiyon mein mehndi lagao, kyunke farishte momin ki mehndi se khush hote hain."
"1368","[AI-translation] Jab tum mein se koi apni biwi ke paas jae to parda kare; agar parda na kare to farishte haya se nikal jaenge aur shaitan hazir hoga; phir agar un ke han bachcha ho to shaitan us mein shareek hoga."
"1369","[AI-translation] Jab Allah kisi bande se mohabbat farmaye, Woh us ki mohabbat farishton ke dilon mein bhi daal deta hai ..."
"1370","[AI-translation] Jab tum mein se koi chheenke aur kahe: Alhamdulillah, farishte kehte hain: Rabb-ul-Aalameen; agar woh kahe: Rabb-ul-Aalameen, to farishte kehte hain: Allah tum par rehem farmaye."
"1371","[AI-translation] Jab juma ka din aae, shaitan subah jhandon ke sath bazaron ki taraf jate hain, logon par fareb ke jaal dalte hain aur unhen juma se rokte hain; aur farishte aate hain aur subah masjidon ke darwazon par baith jate hain ..."
"1372","[AI-translation] Jab maiyyat mare, farishte kehte hain: Us ne aage kya bheja? Log kehte hain: Us ne peeche kya chhora?"
"1373","[AI-translation] Jo kasrat se dua kare, farishte kehte hain: Awaz pehchani gayi, dua qubool hui, hajat poori hui."
"1374","[AI-translation] Chun kar imam banao; jo tumhari namaz padhaye woh tum mein sab se behtar ho; Beshak Allah farishton aur insanon mein se Rasool chunta hai."
"1375","[AI-translation] Behtareen pehra namaz aur zikr ki majlison se chimte rehna hai; jo namaz padh kar apne musalle par baitha rahe, jab tak woh be-wuzu na ho ya khada na ho, farishte us ke liye rehmat ki dua karte rehte hain."
"1376","[AI-translation] Adam ke liye pehlu wali qabr banai gayi aur use taaq pani se ghusl diya gaya, to farishton ne kaha: Yeh us ke baad Adam ki aulad ki sunnat hai."
"1377","[AI-translation] Beshak Adam ko farishton ne pani aur beri ke patton se ghusl diya, kafan diya, pehlu wali qabr banai, aur kaha: Aey Adam ki aulad! Yeh tumhare murdon ke bare mein tumhari sunnat hai."
"1378","[AI-translation] Jab rozedar ke paas khaya jae to farishte us ke liye dua karte hain."
"1379","[AI-translation] Aey Bilal! Jab rozedar ke paas khaya jata hai to us ki haddiyan tasbeeh karti hain aur farishte us ke liye maghfirat mangte hain."
"1380","[AI-translation] Beshak Allah aabid naujawan par farishton ke samne fakhr farmata hai, farmata hai: Mere bande ko dekho; us ne Meri khatir apni khwahish chhor di."
"1381","[AI-translation] Beshak farishte sawar hajiyon se musafaha karte hain aur paidal chalne walon se gale milte hain."
"1382","[AI-translation] Beshak farishte sardi ke mausam ke jane par khush hote hain, Musalman faqiron par ane wali sakhti par rehem karte hue."
"1383","[AI-translation] Farishte tum mein se kisi ke liye dua karte rehte hain jab tak us ka dastarkhwan bichha rahe."
"1384","[AI-translation] Beshak farishte us qaum par nahin utarte jis mein sila-rehmi torne wala ho."
"1385","[AI-translation] Beshak log qayamat ke din teen girohon mein uthaye jaenge ... ek giroh jise farishte munh ke bal ghaseetenge."
"1386","[AI-translation] Phir ham aise bazar aaenge jismein farishte safen bandhe honge; aankhon ne waisa kabhi nahin dekha, kaanon ne kabhi nahin suna, aur dilon mein kabhi khayal na aaya."
"1387","[AI-translation] Beshak main ne farishton ko Hanzalah bin Abi Amir ko aasman aur zameen ke darmiyan chaandi ke bartanon mein badal ke pani se ghusl dete dekha."
"1388","[AI-translation] Beshak main ne farishton ko Hamza ko ghusl dete dekha."
"1389","[AI-translation] Jo mere baad meri ummat ke mamle ka nigran bane, use qayamat ke din Pul-e-Sirat par khada kiya jaega aur farishte us ka a'mal-nama kholenge; agar woh aadil hua to Allah us ke adl ki wajah se use nijat dega ..."
"1390","[AI-translation] Farishton ka tohfa masjidon ko khushbudar rakhna hai."
"1391","[AI-translation] Teen awazon se Allah farishton ke samne fakhr farmata hai: azan, Allah ke raste mein takbeer, aur talbiya buland awaz se padhna."
"1392","[AI-translation] Hooren farishton ki tasbeeh se paida ki gayin."
"1393","[AI-translation] Main ne dekha ke aksar farishte jinhen main ne dekha amame pehne hue the."
"1394","[AI-translation] Main ne apne Rabb se darkhwast ki ke meri ummat par chasht ki namaz farz kar de, to Us ne farmaya: Yeh farishton ki namaz hai; jo chahe padhe, jo chahe chhore."
"1395","[AI-translation] [Bachchon ke] naam Nabiyon ke naamon par rakho, farishton ke naamon par na rakho."
"1396","[AI-translation] Dajjal ke zamane mein mominon ka khana farishton ka khana hoga: tasbeeh aur taqdees."
"1397","[AI-translation] [Allah Azza wa Jalla farmata hai:] Jab [Mera banda] sattar saal ko pahunche, farishte us se mohabbat karte hain ... jab nabbe saal ko pahunche, farishte kehte hain: Zameen par Allah ka qaidi hai; to us ke agle pichhle gunah bakhsh diye jate hain, aur use us ke ghar walon ke haq mein sifarish di jati hai."
"1398","[AI-translation] Badr ke din farishton ki nishani kaale amame the, Uhud ke din surkh amame the."
"1399","[AI-translation] Namazi ki teen sifaat hain ... farishte use us ke qadmon se aasman ke kinare tak gher lete hain."
"1400","[AI-translation] Farishte tumhare khel mein siwae ghud-daud aur teer-andazi ke hazir nahin hote."
"1401","[AI-translation] Jis ghar mein shaam bakriyon ka rewad aae to farishte subah tak un ke liye rehmat ki dua karte rehte hain."
"1402","[AI-translation] Jo ayb beche aur use zahir na kare, to woh musalsal Allah ke ghazab mein rehta hai aur farishte musalsal us par la'nat karte hain."
"1403","[AI-translation] Jo din ke awwal mein Quran khatm kare, farishte shaam tak us ke liye rehmat ki dua karte hain; jo din ke aakhir mein khatm kare, farishte subah tak us ke liye rehmat ki dua karte hain."
"1404","[AI-translation] Jo kisi ko us ke naam ke baghair pukare to farishte us par la'nat karte hain."
"1405","[AI-translation] Momin Allah ke han baaz farishton se ziyada izzat wala hai."
"1406","[AI-translation] Farishte us ghar mein dakhil nahin hote jis mein ghanti ho."
"1407","[AI-translation] Jo subah ilm ki talash mein nikle, farishte us ke liye dua karte hain aur us ki rozi mein barkat di jati hai."
"1408","[AI-translation] Aey Abu Hurairah! Logon ko Quran sikhao aur khud seekho, kyunke agar tum is haal mein maro to farishte tumhari qabr ki ziyarat karenge jaise Bait-ul-Ateeq ki ziyarat ki jati hai."
"1409","[AI-translation] Jo Ramazan mein halal kamai se rozedar ko iftar karaye, to farishte tamam Ramazan ki raaton mein us ke liye rehmat ki dua karte hain ..."
"1410","[AI-translation] Miswak ko lazmi pakdo, behtareen cheez miswak hai ... farishte us ki tareef karte hain, Rabb razi hota hai, aur shaitan naraz hota hai."
"1411","[AI-translation] Farishte noha karne wali par rehmat ki dua nahin karte."
"1412","[AI-translation] Jab Eid-ul-Fitr aae, farishte raston ke dahano par khade hote hain ...."
"1413","[AI-translation] Jab Hawwa hamila huin, Iblees ne un ka chakkar lagaya; un ka koi bachcha zinda na rehta tha, to us ne kaha: Us ka naam Abdul Haris rakho. To unhon ne us ka naam Abdul Haris rakha, phir woh zinda raha."
"1414","[AI-translation] Takabbur se bacho, kyunke Iblees ko Adam ko sajda na karne par takabbur ne ubhara ..."
"1415","[AI-translation] Beshak Allah ka dushman Iblees jab jana ke Allah ne meri dua qubool kar li aur meri ummat ko bakhsh diya, to us ne mitti li aur apne sar par dalne laga."
"1416","[AI-translation] Iblees ki kamar todne wali koi cheez aalim se badh kar nahin jo apne qabeelen mein nikle."
"1417","[AI-translation] Lehsan, pyaaz aur gandanak Iblees ki khushbu mein se hain."
"1418","[AI-translation] Beshak tum mein se jab koi masjid se nikalne lage, Iblees ka lashkar jama hota hai ...."
"1419","[AI-translation] La ilaha illallah aur istighfar ko lazmi pakdo, kasrat se padho, kyunke Iblees kehta hai: Main ne logon ko gunahon se halak kiya aur unhon ne mujhe La ilaha illallah aur istighfar se halak kiya."
"1420","[AI-translation] Beshak Iblees apne sab se sakht aur sab se qawi sathiyon ko us ki taraf bhejta hai jo apne maal ka achcha intezam kare."
"1421","[AI-translation] Sha'iri Iblees ki bansri hai."
"1422","[AI-translation] Duniya se daro aur aurton se daro; Beshak Iblees bahut ghaat lagaye taaq mein hai; muttaqiyon mein us ke shikar ke liye aurton se badh kar koi phanda nahin."
"1423","[AI-translation] To Iblees ne apne Rabb Azza wa Jalla se kaha: Aey Rabb! Adam utar diya gaya ... [Allah ne farmaya:] Us ke Rasool farishte aur un mein chune hue Nabi hain, us ki kitaben Tauraat, Injeel, Zaboor aur Furqan hain. Us ne kaha: Meri kitab kya hai? Allah ne farmaya: Teri kitab tehniyon ke patte hain, tera Quran sha'iri hai, tere Rasool kahin hain, tera khana woh hai jis par Allah ka naam na liya gaya ho, har nashawali cheez tera mashroob hai, tera sach jhoot hai, tera ghar hammam hain, teri ghaat aurten hain, tere moazzin aalaat-e-moseeqi hain, aur teri masjid bazar hai."
"1424","[AI-translation] Sab se pehle jahannam ka libas Iblees ko pehnaya jaega ..."
"1425","[AI-translation] Iblees sab se pehle noha karne wala tha aur sab se pehle gaane wala tha."
"1433","[AI-translation] Jab tum wuzu karo to apne hath na jhatko, kyunke woh shaitan ke pankhe hain."
"1434","[AI-translation] Aurten shaitan ka phanda hain."
"1435","[AI-translation] Shaitan se sab se ziyada rokne wali saf pehli saf hai."
"1436","[AI-translation] Be-hayai aur fahsh-goi shaitan ki taraf se hai; donon jahannam se qareeb aur jannat se door karti hain."
"1437","[AI-translation] Beshak shaitan bahut hassaas aur bahut chaatne wala hai; to apne aap ko us se bachao; jo raat guzare jabke us ke hath mein charbi ki bu ho, phir use kuch pahunche to woh apne siwa kisi ko malamat na kare."
"1438","[AI-translation] Beshak shaitan insan ka bhediya hai jaise bakriyon ka bhediya: woh alag hone wali bakri pakadta hai ... to alag hone se bacho, jamaat, aam jaghon aur masjid se chimte raho."
"1439","[AI-translation] Beshak shaitan ek aur do ko satata hai; jab woh teen hon to unhen nahin sata sakta."
"1440","[AI-translation] Beshak shaitan Umar se us ke Islam lane ke baad jab mila munh ke bal gira."
"1441","[AI-translation] Beshak shaitan Adam ke bete ke dil par apna thoothan rakhta hai; agar woh Allah ka zikr kare to peeche hatega; agar bhool jae to us ke dil ko nigal lega."
"1442","[AI-translation] Beshak shaitan surkh rang se mohabbat karta hai; surkh aur har shohrat wale kapde se bacho."
"1443","[AI-translation] Surkh se bacho, kyunke woh shaitan ko sab se mahboob zeenat hai."
"1444","[AI-translation] Surkh shaitan ki zeenat hai."
"1445","[AI-translation] Beshak jo imam se pehle jhuke aur uthe, us ki peshani shaitan ke hath mein hai."
"1446","[AI-translation] Ek ungli se khana shaitan ka khana hai, do ungliyon se sarkashon ka khana hai, aur teen ungliyon se Nabiyon ka khana hai."
"1447","[AI-translation] Rona rehmat se hai, cheekhna shaitan ki taraf se hai."
"1448","[AI-translation] Sakht jamai aur sakht chheenk shaitan ki taraf se hai."
"1449","[AI-translation] Qahqaha shaitan ki taraf se hai, muskurahat Allah ki taraf se hai."
"1450","[AI-translation] Koi Nabi kabhi ehtelam mein mubtala na hua; ehtelam shaitan ki taraf se hai."
"1451","[AI-translation] Taal-matol shaitan ka nishan hai jo woh mominon ke dilon mein dalta hai."
"1452","[AI-translation] Namaz shaitan ka chehra kaala karti hai."
"1453","[AI-translation] Apni zaban par khair jama rakho, Beshak is se tum shaitan par ghalib aaoge."
"1454","[AI-translation] Kam bolo, warna shaitan tumhen behka dega."
"1455","[AI-translation] Nazar-e-bad haq hai; use shaitan aur Adam ke bete ka hasad lata hai."
"1456","[AI-translation] Banda apne deen mein hamesha wus'at mein rehta hai jab tak sharab na piye; jab woh sharab piye to Allah us ka haya ka parda chaak kar deta hai, shaitan us ki sama'at, basarat aur qadmon ka wali ban jata hai. Woh use har shar ki taraf le jata hai aur har khair se pher deta hai."
"1457","[AI-translation] Aap ne ek saans mein janwaron ki tarah [paani] peene se mana farmaya aur farmaya: Yeh shaitan ka peena hai."
"1458","[AI-translation] Allah ki qasam! Shaitan us ke sath khata raha yahan tak ke us ne bismillah padhi ..."
"1459","[AI-translation] Har ghar jis mein safed murgha ho, shaitan aur jadugar us ke qareeb nahin aate."
"1460","[AI-translation] Apni dadhiyon aur nakhunon ka khilal karo, Beshak shaitan gosht aur nakhun ke darmiyan daudta hai."
"1461","[AI-translation] Jab [jang-e-Mota mein] Hazrat Ja'far bin Abi Talib (Raziyallahu anhu) ne jhanda pakda, shaitan un ke paas aaya aur un mein duniyawi khwahish ubhari ...."
"1462","[AI-translation] Beshak shaitan ke phandon aur jaalon mein se hain Allah ki nemat ka inkar, Allah ke diye par fakhr, Allah ke bandon par takabbur ..."
"1463","[AI-translation] Aalim ki aabid par fazeelat sattar darje hai ... kyunke shaitan logon ke liye bid'at nikalta hai, aalim use pehchanta hai phir use rokta hai ..."
"1464","[AI-translation] Aap ne kamre mein kachra chhorne se mana farmaya, kyunke woh shaitan ke baithne ki jagah hai."
"1465","[AI-translation] Jo chahe ke shaitan ko us ke paas khana aur qailoola na mile, use chahie ke ghar mein dakhil hote hue salam kahe aur apne khane par bismillah padhe."
"1466","[AI-translation] Jab Adam ka beta soe, farishta shaitan se kehta hai: Apna register dikha, phir woh dikhata hai ..."
"1467","[AI-translation] Bad-akhlaqi Allah ke azab ki lagaam hai bad-akhlaq ki naak mein, lagaam shaitan ke hath mein hai; shaitan use shar ki taraf kheenchta hai aur shar use aag ki taraf kheenchta hai."
"1468","[AI-translation] Toote hue bartan se na piyo, kyunke shaitan us se peeta hai."
"1469","[AI-translation] Makdi shaitan hai; Allah ne us ki surat maskh ki, to use qatl kar do."
"1470","[AI-translation] Qaus-e-Qazah na kaho [badalon mein nazar ane wali rangeen kaman], kyunke Qazah shaitan ka naam hai; balke use Allah ki kaman kaho."
"1471","[AI-translation] Ek sahabi ne apne bete ka naam Hubab rakha. Jab Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko maloom hua, Aap ne farmaya: Use Hubab na rakho, kyunke Hubab shaitan ka naam hai."
"1472","[AI-translation] Beshak Shihab shaitan ka naam hai."
"1473","[AI-translation] Mujhe Adam par do sifaat se fazeelat di gayi: mera shaitan kafir tha phir Allah ne mujhe us par madad di yahan tak ke woh Musalman ho gaya, meri biwiyan meri madadgar hain, jabke Adam ka shaitan kafir raha aur us ki biwi us ki khata mein us ki madadgar thi."
"1474","[AI-translation] Aasman mein koi farishta nahin siwae is ke ke woh Umar ki tauqeer karta hai, zameen mein koi shaitan nahin siwae is ke ke woh Umar se darta hai."
"1475","[AI-translation] Jab yateem kisi qaum ke bartan par baithe, to shaitan un ke bartan ke qareeb aata hai."
"1476","[AI-translation] [Us se jis ke paas gunjaish hote hue biwi ya laundi na ho, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya:] Tum shaitanon ke bhaiyon mein se ho."
"1477","[AI-translation] Beshak shaitan subah jhandon ke sath bazaron ki taraf jata hai; woh pehle dakhil hone wale ke sath dakhil hota hai aur aakhri nikalne wale ke sath nikalta hai."
"1478","[AI-translation] Beshak Iblees ke sarkash shaitan hain; woh un se kehta hai: Hajiyon aur mujahidon ko [seedhe] raste se behkao."
"1479","[AI-translation] Jab tum apne kamron mein dakhil ho to salam kaho, un mein rehne wale shaitan nikal jaenge."
"1480","[AI-translation] Apne gharon ko jitna ho sake raushan rakho; Beshak jis ghar mein Quran padha jae woh apne ghar walon par wasee ho jata hai, us ki khair badh jati hai, farishte hazir hote hain, aur shaitan nikal jate hain ..."
"1481","[AI-translation] Beshak Allah ke shaitan zameen par hain jo samandar walon par qudrat nahin rakhte, aur samandar mein shaitan hain jo zameen walon par qudrat nahin rakhte ..."
"1482","[AI-translation] Jab banda apni namaz ke liye khada ho, saat shaitan us ke sath khade hote hain."
"1483","[AI-translation] Jab tum in janwaron par sawar ho to unhen manzilon mein un ka haq do; un par shaitanon ki tarah sawar na ho."
"1484","[AI-translation] ... Allah us ke sath shaitan bhejega jo logon se baat karenge ..."
"1485","[AI-translation] Aey Abu Zarr! Jinn aur insan ke shaitanon ke shar se Allah ki panah mango. Main ne kaha: Kya insanon mein bhi shaitan hain? Aap ne farmaya: Han."
"1486","[AI-translation] Iblees Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya jab Aap masjid mein apne sahaba ki jamaat ke sath the aur us ne Aap se bahut si cheezon ke bare mein poocha."
"1487","[AI-translation] Aalim ki maut Iblees ke nazdeek sattar aabidon ki maut se ziyada mahboob hai."
"1488","[AI-translation] Aap ne jinn ke liye zabeehon se mana farmaya [yani woh zabeeha jo koi ghar banane ke baad is niyyat se kare ke jinn ghar walon ko nuqsan na pahunchaen]."
"1489","[AI-translation] Jibreel mere paas aae aur kaha: Beshak sarkash jinn tumhare khilaf bura chahta hai; jab tum bistar par leto to Ayat-ul-Kursi padho."
"1490","[AI-translation] Musalman aur mushrik jinn mere paas jhagadte hue aae aur unhon ne mujh se rehne ki jagah mangi; to main ne Musalman jinnon ko Jalas [pahad aur aabadi] mein basaya aur mushrik jinnon ko Ghaur [pahad aur samandar ke darmiyan ilaqa] mein basaya."
"1491","[AI-translation] Apne aap ko aur apne ghar walon ko shaam ke shuru mein gharon mein roko, kyunke us mein jinn phailte hain."
"1492","[AI-translation] Allah ne jinn teen qism ke paida kiye: saanp, bichhu aur zameen ke keede-makode ki surat mein; hawa mein hawa ki tarah; aur woh jin se hisab liya jaega aur azab diya jaega."
"1493","[AI-translation] Gheelan [jinn ki ek khaas qism] jinnon ke jadugar hain."
"1494","[AI-translation] Koi cheez nahin siwae is ke ke woh janti hai main Allah ka Rasool hun siwae kafir jinnon aur kafir insanon ke."
"1495","[AI-translation] Taoon ki beemari tumhare jinn bhaiyon ka dank hai."
"1496","[AI-translation] Gandagi ke sattar hisse hain; ek hissa jinn aur insan mein hai, unhattar [69] hisse Barbar [shumal-maghribi Africa ki qaum] mein hain."
"1497","[AI-translation] Beshak aurat jab apne ghar se nikle jabke us ka shohar us ke nikalne ko napasand kare, to wapas aane tak aasman ka har farishta aur har cheez jis ke paas se woh guzre us par la'nat karti hai siwae jinn aur insan ke."
"1498","[AI-translation] Agar insan, jinn, shaitan aur farishte takhliq se qayamat tak ek saf mein khade hon, tab bhi woh Allah ko gher nahin sakte."
"1499","[AI-translation] Kya tum jante ho khurafa kya hai? Khurafa Banu Uzrah ka ek aadmi tha jise jinn ne qaid kar liya tha; woh un mein lambi muddat raha ...."
"1500","[AI-translation] Jinn us ko nuqsan nahin pahunchate jis ke ghar mein umda ghoda ho."
"1501","[AI-translation] Koi banda jannat mein dakhil na hoga siwae is ke ke do hooren us ke sar ke paas aur do us ke qadmon ke paas baithengi, use behtareen awaz se sunaengi jo jinn aur insan sunenge."
"1502","[AI-translation] Qayamat qayam na hogi yahan tak ke tum mein tumhari aurton se jinnon ki aulad kasrat se ho ..."
"1503","[AI-translation] ... Yeh kaale kutte jinnon mein se hain."
"1504","[AI-translation] Beshak momin jinnon ko sawab milega aur unhen azab bhi milega ..."
"1505","[AI-translation] Aey chacha! Beshak Allah ne mujhe jinn aur insan se mehfooz kar diya hai."
"1506","[AI-translation] Aap ne makhsoos aurton se nikah se mana farmaya."
"1507","[AI-translation] Insan ke shaitan jinn ke shaitanon par ghalib hain."
"1508","[AI-translation] Kitabullah mein nazar-e-bad ke liye aath aayaten hain; jo banda unhen ghar mein padhe to us din use kisi insan ya jinn ki nazar na lagegi: Surah Fatiha saat aayaten aur Ayat-ul-Kursi ek aayat hai."
